# Mesh

# By key

# Only node
GET http://localhost:8010/api/data/mesh?start:gt=0032-04-28&labels=Territory,Person

###

# With relations of any type
GET http://localhost:8010/api/data/mesh?key=vespasian&relations=*


###

# With relations of type 'RELATIONSHIP_WITH' or 'CHILD_OF'
GET http://localhost:8010/api/data/mesh?key=vespasian&relations=RELATIONSHIP_WITH,CHILD_OF

